# The play screen's actions: a click on the board (the Exchange's $) with the
# belt tool is refused with its reason; tool keys (R, X) and buttons; Hint (H)
# selects the hinted cell; one tick (Space); Pause (Escape) and resume (P);
# the Sound toggle; How to play and back (Escape); Undo in a lesson; leaving
# to the title from the pause menu.
until 300 Play
frames 10
click Lessons (Learn)
until 60 Lay the line
click Lay the line
until 120 Run one tick (Space)
frames 5
click $
until 30 That cell is already occupied.
key KeyR 2
until 30 Tool: rotate
click Remove
until 30 Tool: remove
key KeyB 2
until 30 Tool: belt
key ArrowLeft 2
frames 2
key Enter 2
until 30 Built a belt.
key KeyZ 2
until 30 Undid the last action.
expect Tick: 0
key KeyZ 2
until 30 Nothing to undo.
key Space 2
until 30 Tick: 1
key KeyH 2
until 30 Keep delivering goods
key Escape 2
until 30 The simulation is stopped.
frames 5
click Sound: on
until 30 Sound: off
click Sound: off
until 30 Sound: on
click How to play
until 30 Goods ride conveyor belts
frames 5
key Escape 2
until 30 Run one tick (Space)
frames 5
key KeyP 2
until 30 Resume
key KeyP 2
until 30 Run one tick (Space)
key Escape 2
until 30 Leave round
frames 5
click Leave round
until 60 Daily Challenge
